      "context_text": "Hey Prabhu If you had not grasped this land If you had not taught us the values of Ahimsa, Truth non-stealing, celibacy, non-possessionness. Then Even we would be doing so many wrong activities like the other living beings on this planet. even they would have been involved in violence lies stealing possessions We would also be polluting our soul with these bad qualities. Hey Prabhu With a vow in our hearts to bow down to you. and express our heartfelt Vandana Prabhu, it is your infinite grace on each and every one of us. Prabhu, you practiced tough Sadhana for twelve and a half long years.",
